{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ② 조건·반복·리스트","level":2,"title":"음수가 있는가","desc":"<p>리스트에 <b>음수가 하나라도 있으면</b> <code>True</code>, 없으면 <code>False</code>를 돌려주는 함수 <code>any_negative(nums)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def any_negative(nums):\n    pass\n","solution":"def any_negative(nums):\n    for x in nums:\n        if x < 0:\n            return True\n    return False\n","hint":"<p>찾으면 바로 <code>True</code>를 돌려주고, 끝까지 없으면 <code>False</code>예요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"any_negative([1, -2])","expected":true,"visible":true},{"call":"any_negative([1, 2])","expected":false,"visible":true},{"call":"any_negative([])","expected":false,"visible":false},{"call":"any_negative([-5])","expected":true,"visible":false}],"id":"py-310"}